id: mbedtls_ecdsa_deterministic
package: security_mbedtls
label: Legacy Deterministic ECDSA
description: "This component provides support for signature generation with deterministic ECDSA (RFC-6979) using Mbed TLS.\n\nWARNING: \n Adding support for deterministic ECDSA through Mbed TLS will preclude regular ECDSA operations using the Mbed TLS API from being accelerated on Series-2 devices. ECDSA operations on those devices using the corresponding PSA API are unaffected. \n\nNOTE: \n The PSA Crypto component for Deterministic ECDSA (psa_crypto_ecdsa_deterministic.slcc) is recommended over Legacy Deterministic ECDSA (mbedtls_ecdsa_deterministic.slcc) in Mbed TLS for future support since the legacy low level crypto APIs of Mbed TLS is planned to be removed from Mbed TLS 4.0 APIs."

category: Platform|Security|Mbed TLS|Signatures
quality: production
provides:
- name: mbedtls_ecdsa_deterministic
requires:
- name: mbedtls_ecdsa
- name: mbedtls_hash
template_contribution:
- name: mbedtls_config
  value: MBEDTLS_ECDSA_DETERMINISTIC
- name: mbedtls_config
  value: MBEDTLS_HMAC_DRBG_C
metadata:
  sbom:
    reference: mbedtls_sbom
root_path: security_mbedtls
